{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>They are holy garments.</b> In their quantity the angels appear to the prophets, for they then appear in garments of linen (Ezekiel 9:3, Daniel 12:6–7)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {0 "Reading בְּכַמּוּתָם as 'in their quantity/number,' referring to the four linen garments; the sense is that angels appear to prophets wearing a corresponding set of linen garments."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:25.510402379Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}